PFACT    :   Crout 
NBMIN    :       2 
NDIV     :       2 
RFACT    :   Crout 
BCAST    :   2ring 
DEPTH    :       1 
SWAP     : Mix (threshold = 16)
L1       : transposed form
U        : transposed form
EQUIL    : yes
ALIGN    :   16 double precision words

